    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d179">

                <pb facs="0296" n="184" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg184"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 893.51/1945b</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Chargé in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >MacMurray</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-07-31T17:00:00-04:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 31, 1918, 5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Chinese Minister here some days ago promised to inquire of his Government the
                    amount of loan desired, for what purposes, and upon what security. No reply thus
                    far received. Please obtain the information which is needed by the banking group
                    here prepared to lend.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
